","Practitioner"],"date":"2025-07-21T16:07:42Z","code":[{"system":"http://fhir.openmrs.org/code-system/encounter-type","code":"b5f4d12e-08cb-459d-83c9-d8b4992c93e7","display":"WHO-5"},{"system":"http://fhir.openmrs.org/core/StructureDefinition/omrs-form","code":"51049641-1a9c-361f-8f42-3d3f9f7d8ee8","display":"WHO-5"}],"item":[{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/questionnaire-itemControl","valueCodeableConcept":{"coding":[{"system":"http://hl7.org/fhir/questionnaire-item-control","code":"page","display":"Page"}],"text":"Page"}}],"linkId":"page-who-5","type":"group","item":[{"linkId":"section-who-5","text":"WHO-5 (World Health Organization-5 Well-Being Index)","_text":{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"fr"},{"url":"content","valueString":"WHO-5 (Indice de bien-être de l'Organisation mondiale de la Santé - 5)"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ar"},{"url":"content","valueString":"WHO-5 (مؤشر الرفاهية لمنظمة الصحة العالمية - 5)"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ru"},{"url":"content","valueString":"ВОЗ-5 (Индекс благополучия Всемирной организации здравоохранения-5)"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"es"},{"url":"content","valueString":"WHO-5 (Índice de Bienestar de la Organización Mundial de la Salud-5)"}]}]},"type":"group","item":[{"linkId":"who5-objective-instructions","text":"Objective: The WHO-5 is a brief, self-reported scale designed to assess an individual's subjective well-being and mental health, particularly focusing on emotional well-being over the past two weeks.","_text":{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"fr"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Objectif : Le WHO-5 est une échelle d'auto-évaluation brève conçue pour évaluer le bien-être subjectif et la santé mentale d'un individu, en se concentrant particulièrement sur le bien-être émotionnel au cours des deux dernières semaines."}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"es"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Objetivo: El WHO-5 es una escala breve de autoinforme diseñada para evaluar el bienestar subjetivo y la salud mental de un individuo, centrándose especialmente en el bienestar emocional durante las últimas dos semanas."}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ru"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Цель: WHO-5 — это краткая шкала самоотчета, предназначенная для оценки субъективного благополучия и психического здоровья человека, с особым акцентом на эмоциональное состояние в течение последних двух недель."}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ar"},{"url":"content","valueString":"الهدف: مؤشر منظمة الصحة العالمية (WHO-5) هو مقياس موجز للتقرير الذاتي مصمم لتقييم الرفاهية الذاتية والصحة النفسية للفرد، مع التركيز بشكل خاص على الرفاهية العاطفية خلال الأسبوعين الماضيين."}]}]},"type":"display"},{"linkId":"who5-target-population-instructions","text":"Target Population: Adults (18+), applicable to general populations, but commonly used in clinical settings to screen for depression or general mental health issues. It is often used in both general population surveys and in evaluating mental health outcomes in various interventions.","_text":{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"fr"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Population cible : Adultes (18 ans et plus), applicable aux populations générales, mais couramment utilisé dans les milieux cliniques pour dépister la dépression ou les problèmes de santé mentale généraux."}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"es"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Población objetivo: Adultos (18+), aplicable a poblaciones generales, pero comúnmente utilizada en entornos clínicos para detectar la depresión o problemas generales de salud mental."}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ru"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Целевая группа: Взрослые (18+), применимо к общему населению, но обычно используется в клинических условиях для скрининга депрессии или общих проблем с психическим здоровьем."}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ar"},{"url":"content","valueString":"الفئة المستهدفة: البالغون (18+)، وينطبق على عامة السكان، ولكنه يشيع استخدامه في الإعدادات السريرية لفحص الاكتئاب أو مشاكل الصحة النفسية العامة."}]}]},"type":"display"},{"linkId":"who5-timeframe-instructions","text":"Please indicate for each of the five statements which is closest to how you have been feeling over the last two weeks.","_text":{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"fr"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Veuillez indiquer pour chacune des cinq affirmations celle qui se rapproche le plus de ce que vous avez ressenti au cours des deux dernières semaines."}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"es"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Indique para cada una de las cinco afirmaciones cuál es la que más se aproxima a cómo se ha sentido durante las últimas dos semanas."}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ru"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Пожалуйста, укажите для каждого из пяти утверждений то, которое наиболее точно описывает ваше самочувствие в течение последних двух недель."}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ar"},{"url":"content","valueString":"يرجى تحديد أي من العبارات الخمس هي الأقرب إلى شعورك خلال الأسبوعين الماضيين."}]}]},"type":"display"},{"linkId":"who5-rating-scale-instructions","text":"The rating scale is as follows: 0 = At no time | 1 = Some of the time | 2 = Less than half of the time | 3 = More than half of the time | 4 = Most of the time | 5 = All of the time","_text":{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"fr"},{"url":"content","valueString":"L'échelle d'évaluation est la suivante : 0 = Jamais | 1 = De temps en temps | 2 = Moins de la moitié du temps | 3 = Plus de la moitié du temps | 4 = La plupart du temps | 5 = Tout le temps"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"es"},{"url":"content","valueString":"La escala de calificación es la siguiente: 0 = En ningún momento | 1 = Algunas veces | 2 = Menos de la mitad del tiempo | 3 = Más de la mitad del tiempo | 4 = La mayor parte del tiempo | 5 = Todo el tiempo"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ru"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Шкала оценки выглядит следующим образом: 0 = Никогда | 1 = Иногда | 2 = Менее половины времени | 3 = Более половины времени | 4 = Большую часть времени | 5 = Все время"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ar"},{"url":"content","valueString":"مقياس التقييم هو كما يلي: 0 = أبداً | 1 = بعض الوقت | 2 = أقل من نصف الوقت | 3 = أكثر من نصف الوقت | 4 = معظم الوقت | 5 = طوال الوقت"}]}]},"type":"display"},{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/questionnaire-itemControl","valueCodeableConcept":{"coding":[{"system":"http://hl7.org/fhir/questionnaire-item-control","code":"dateTime"}]}}],"linkId":"encounter-encounterDate","de